          "type": "text",
          "text": "A school has 480 students. In a pie chart, sports clubs have a sector of 135°. A bar chart of these members shows football 54, badminton 46 and swimming x. A pictogram of the swimming members who compete has 4 icons, and each icon represents 4 students. What percentage of the swimming members compete? Enter the percentage without the % sign."
        }
      ],
      "marks": 5,
      "primary_outcome": "1.2",
      "secondary_outcomes": [],
      "response": {
        "type": "numeric",
        "comparison_mode": "exact_numeric",
        "canonical_answer": "20",
